di scelto per insegnare il farsi al direttore del campo, un uomo che sogna di aprire un ristorante in Iran una volta finita la guerra. Il particolare rapporto tra i due uomini finisce però con la scatenare la gelosia di altri prigionieri e ufficiali...","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2020-04-17","status":"Released","rating":7.592,"ratingCount":532,"genres":["Guerra","Dramma"],"countries":["Russia","Germany","Belarus","France"],"facts":{"Runtime":"127m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":66957,"name":"Nahuel Pérez Biscayart","role":"Gilles","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/27JLQmsKTwKO3WbIVJyBE4iI7za.jpg"},{"id":111420,"name":"Lars Eidinger","role":"Klaus Koch","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l42T2eq3UTlQWsGlpIJUTyyp7sp.jpg"},{"id":585492,"name":"Jonas Nay","role":"Max","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bBzLIK6mS6PIqxGy7EydONZdZ1z.jpg"},{"id":119065,"name":"Leonie Benesch","role":"Elsa","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dXs2srrTNOTOZXNa0UOaO9xx2QL.jpg"},{"id":4796,"name":"Alexander Beyer","role":"Camp Commander","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xuD0crcNa6gViFShvFCsY1ZOgLW.jpg"},{"id":1327315,"name":"David Schütter","role":"Paul","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eCyL55l0fb9tccOQfdCGCd7XKAf.jpg"},{"id":1658379,"name":"Luisa-Céline Gaffron","role":"Yana","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tOf2gUN32v2vzngjf2GwKzfpsJ9.jpg"},{"id":1381614,"name":"Andreas Hofer","role":"Adjutant von Dewitz","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/32Pa9Co03GwPqZ82mzrmUCBUCXN.jpg"},{"id":1486635,"name":"Giuseppe Schillaci","role":"Marco Rossi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8XSOXUf4HMhPbcYSHT9GSFNhvbd.jpg"},{"id":146081,"name":"Antonin Chalon","role":"Jacob Rossi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qmbCVdVvdgqlnjTNC1NpvomPvAR.jpg"},{"id":1112590,"name":"Lola Bessis","role":"Melanie","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nlWXzWw